/**
 * Whether a live session should take its phase's freshly resolved profile
 * before its next turn (B3): never while a turn is already in flight, since
 * that one finishes on the model it started on; never on a resolution that
 * refused (B6), which is offered rather than applied; and only when the
 * resolved profile actually differs, so a choice that resolves the same as
